# Title: <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
# | Type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore
# | Scope: optional, module/component name
# 
# feat:     New functionality
# fix:      Error correction  
# docs:     Changes in documentation
# style:    Formatting changes (spaces, semicolons, etc.)
# refactor: Code refactoring (without changing behavior)
# perf:     Performance Changes
# test:     Adding or correcting tests
# chore:    Changes in the build process or auxiliary tools
#
# Example: feat(metrics): add memory usage monitoring
# Example: fix(x11): handle session timeout edge case
# Example: perf(collector): optimize data collection by 40%
#
# Body: detailed description (if necessary)
# Footer: BREAKING CHANGE or links to issues